ng gum, and salt. It is believed that throughout much of its history, Muyil had strong ties to the center of Coba located some 44 km the north / northwest. The 2010 federal census reported a population of 191 inhabitants in the locality."], "document_offset": 0, "logical_document_count": 1, "physical_batch_limit": 4, "score_contract": "pointwise", "score_space": "unit_interval", "sequence": 426, "elapsed_seconds": 0.24570393562316895}
